  "_comment": "R17-A1 / AT-430 — deterministic offline fixture for the Teams change-based ingestor. Channels exercise the granted-standard-only access rule (AC4): only standard channels AgentIQ is explicitly granted are read; private channels, ungranted channels and archived channels are excluded, and private chats / DMs are never modelled (the connector never enumerates the /chats surface). Per-channel messages carry a monotonic 'change_seq' modelling the Microsoft Graph delta ordering, so incremental (since-deltatoken) and resumable first-load batching can both be tested. The delta-token map in the checkpoint is keyed by '{team_id}/{channel_id}'.",
